[9.367, "o", "\u001b[0;36m> using podman container \u00b7 asking opencode \u00b7 using deepseek-v4-flash-free\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[10.167, "o", "\u001b[0m\r\n> build \u00b7 deepseek-v4-flash-free\r\n\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[10.967, "o", "\u001b[0m\u2699 \u001b[0mard-google-discovery_ard_search {\"query\":\"SQL query optimization and performance tuning best practices for databases\"}\r\n"]
[11.088, "o", "\u001b[0m\u2699 \u001b[0mard-google-discovery_ard_search {\"query\":\"zero-trust security architecture design and policy configuration\"}\r\n"]
[11.888, "o", "Found these \u2014 all Tier 0 (no auth, ready to use):\r\n\r\n**SQL optimization**\r\n- **BigQuery SQL & Performance Guidelines** \u2014 SQL optimization, partitioning/clustering, window functions. Score 100. Best match.\r\n- **Cloud SQL, AlloyDB & Spanner Database Design** \u2014 schema normalization, columnar indexing, connection pooling.\r\n- **Database MCPs** (BigQuery, Cloud SQL, AlloyDB) \u2014 need GCP auth (Tier 3), for actually executing queries.\r\n\r\n**Zero-trust security**\r\n- **Well-Architected Security Skill** \u2014 zero-trust patterns, IAM least-privilege, network perimeters, encryption. Score 100.\r\n- **GKE Architecture** \u2014 Cilium/network policy hardening (if containerized).\r\n- **Firebase Architecture** \u2014 security rules validation (NoSQL).\r\n\r\nI can load any of these skills and give you detailed best practices \u2014 which one(s) do you want?\r\n"]
